From c58b665f84dda6834a0a731f32e68a8d7d44ff47 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: manas kumar <manas.kumar.ug23@nsut.ac.in>
Date: Mon, 20 Apr 2026 10:07:43 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] refactor(components): drop redundant ?? {} fallback when
 spreading modelKwargs

Spreading null/undefined inside an object literal is a no-op per spec, so
`{ ...(obj.modelKwargs ?? {}), ...parsedExtraBody }` simplifies to
`{ ...obj.modelKwargs, ...parsedExtraBody }`.

Addresses review feedback from gemini-code-assist.
